# can arrive on is ignored here, not just the ones we happen to use today.
# NOTE: a pattern like "data/raw/" contains a slash and is therefore anchored
# to this file's directory - it would NOT match fase1/data/raw/. The leading
# **/ is what makes these match at any depth.
